title: Newly registered domain on the path
severity: medium
score: 25
tags: newly-registered
attack: T1583.001
description: The submitted, redirect or final domain was registered less than 30 days ago.
  Third- party resources do not count.
---
// A domain on the visitor's path (not a third-party resource) registered less than 30
// days ago.
domains
| where on_path and age_days < 30
| project domain, age_days
